   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "worried", "action": "hold", "look": "camera"}, "card": {"mood": "smug", "look": "qb"}}},
  {"text": "Aaron Rodgers threw sixty yards to Jeff Janis. First down.",
   "cap": "Aaron Rodgers threw 60 yards to Jeff Janis. First down.",
   "key": ["60"],
   "place": {"wr": [1.8, -1.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "low", "on": "qb"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "angry", "action": "throw", "look": "wr"}, "wr": {"mood": "happy", "action": "cheer"}}},
  {"text": "Then, with five seconds left, a Hail Mary. Janis again. Touchdown.",
   "cap": "Then, with 5 seconds left, a Hail Mary. Janis again. Touchdown.",
   "key": ["HAIL", "MARY."],
   "board": ["0:05", "TOUCHDOWN"],
   "place": {"wr": [0, 0], "qb": false, "card": [1.6, -0.4]},
   "shot": {"type": "low", "on": "wr", "offset": [-0.6, 0, 0]},
   "act": {"wr": {"mood": "shocked", "action": "cheer", "look": "camera"}, "card": {"mood": "shocked", "action": "facepalm"}}},
  {"text": "Extra point. Twenty all. Overtime.",
   "cap": "Extra point. 20 all. Overtime.",
   "key": ["20"],
   "board": ["CARDINALS 20", "PACKERS 20"],
   "place": {"qb": [-1.4, 0], "wr": [0, 0.4], "card": [2.0, -0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "wide", "on": "wr"},
   "act": {"qb": {"mood": "happy", "action": "cheer"}, "wr": {"mood": "happy", "action": "cheer"}, "card": {"mood": "worried", "action": "idle"}}},
  {"text": "Now, the coin toss. Rodgers called tails.",
   "key": ["TAILS."],
   "board": ["OVERTIME", "COIN TOSS"],
   "place": {"wr": false, "card": false, "capy": [0, 1.4], "qb": [-1.8, -0.2], "ref": [1.8, -0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "two", "on": "capy", "with": "qb"},
   "act": {"capy": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "point", "look": "qb"}, "qb": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "point", "look": "ref"}, "ref": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "hold", "look": "qb"}},
   "speaker": "capy"},
  {"text": "The coin went up and came down flat. It never turned over.",
   "key": ["FLAT."],
   "board": ["FLIPS:", "0"],
   "place": {"capy": false, "ref": [0, 0], "qb": [-1.8, 0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "high", "on": "ref"},
   "act": {"ref": {"mood": "confused", "action": "shrug"}, "qb": {"mood": "confused", "look": "ref"}}},
  {"text": "A Packers linebacker said it sat there like a saucer.",
   "key": ["SAUCER."],
   "place": {"lb": [0, 0], "ref": false, "qb": false},
   "shot": {"type": "close", "on": "lb"},
   "act": {"lb": {"mood": "angry", "action": "talk", "look": "camera"}}},
  {"text": "So the referee tossed it again. Without a new call.",
   "key": ["AGAIN."],
   "place": {"lb": false, "ref": [0, 0], "qb": [-1.8, 0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "medium", "on": "ref"},
   "act": {"ref": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "throw", "look": "camera"}, "qb": {"mood": "angry", "action": "point", "look": "ref"}}},
  {"text": "Heads. Arizona got the ball.",
   "key": ["ARIZONA"],
   "board": ["COIN:", "HEADS"],
   "place": {"card": [1.8, 0.2]},
   "shot": {"type": "two", "on": "ref", "with": "card"},
   "act": {"card": {"mood": "happy", "action": "cheer"}, "ref": {"mood": "neutral", "action": "point", "look": "card"}, "qb": {"mood": "angry", "action": "cross"}}},
  {"text": "Rodgers called it confusing. The league said no rule required the coin to flip.",
